######################################

###

### Get all products - via API Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

###

### Get inventory by product code - via API Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/SPORT-001

###

### Eureka dashboard via API Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/eureka/web
